# mychan
===
 Tangle Analysis: A learning tool for Tangle Theory. K lines are automatically decomposed into pens, line segments, pivots, and trend types step by step. Each level can be switched on and off step by step to see the same market trend; you can also practice decomposition and import your own data. Free, Windows, macOS, Linux. ..
